[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0130","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0145","title":"Debian GNU/Linux gnucash 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 系统中 gnucash 财务软件所依赖的 libguile.so 共享库文件被错误地设置了全局可写权限（world-writable）。本地攻击者可利用此权限缺陷修改该库文件，注入恶意代码，当其他用户或进程加载该库时触发执行，从而导致权限提升或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 发行版，CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0145"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05Z","remediation":"立即以 root 身份执行 `chmod 755 /usr/lib/libguile.so` 移除全局可写权限，并确认文件属主为 root:root。使用 `find / -type f -perm -o+w -name \"*.so*\" 2>/dev/null` 扫描系统其他存在相同问题的共享库文件，对非预期可写的 .so 文件统一执行 `chmod 755`。同时检查该文件是否被篡改（与原始 deb 包的 md5sum 比对），如有异常应重新安装 libguile 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0145","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0145","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/89a21c5c97923550694ebf8b925bdcbb260bc495/2000/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0145.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hpp7-x4c7-r2pf/GHSA-hpp7-x4c7-r2pf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88323/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0130.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0116","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0129","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 畸形 .lnk 文件处理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 2.5/a/b 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞位于 SHGetPathFromIDList 函数处理 .lnk 快捷方式文件的过程中。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送特制的 LIST 命令，传入畸形的 .lnk 文件路径触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标 FTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 平台上的 Serv-U FTP Server 2.5/a/b 版本，无需身份认证即可远程触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0129"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03Z","remediation":"升级到 Serv-U FTP Server 3.0 或更高版本。若无法升级，在防火墙中禁用主动 FTP 模式并限制 .lnk 文件上传的 MIME 类型检查作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0129","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19743","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0129.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0129","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/188d63c0a7229de21afb50db15586e9fc8647d16/2000/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e38df7a80f8aa0122f9b0f7f660a5a952c979cc6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gxwp-5gp4-w46m/GHSA-gxwp-5gp4-w46m.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0129.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0074","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0089","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 RDISK 注册表枚举文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 及 Terminal Server Edition 中的 RDISK 实用程序在创建紧急修复磁盘时，会将注册表配置单元信息以临时文件形式存储在磁盘上，且该临时文件权限设置不当，允许本地用户读取其中敏感数据，导致信息泄露。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，通过访问临时目录中的注册表备份文件即可获取系统账户哈希、配置信息等敏感数据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0089"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 针对 Windows NT 4.0 和 Terminal Server Edition 的安全更新 (MS00-003)，该补丁修正了 rdisk 工具将注册表配置单元写入临时文件时权限设置不当的问题。如无法安装补丁，可通过限制用户对 rdisk.exe 的执行权限，并删除 `%TEMP%` 目录下 `rdisk*` 临时文件来进行临时缓解。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ249108","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/947","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-004","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0089","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0089.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b877d0b06ff3c980d2ef6a3eb41e4e2bf2ab8ff9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3mg-h7x2-6r8x/GHSA-h3mg-h7x2-6r8x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/chandanbn/notes/blob/90eb64532f7259c55e5531dfc2726d810d17ef6e/cve5-validation-errors-Jan27.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0333","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0128","title":"Daniel Beckham The Finger Server 0.82 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Daniel Beckham The Finger Server 0.82 Beta 版本中存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Finger 服务发送包含 shell 元字符的特制请求，利用管道符等特殊字符执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 The Finger Server 0.82 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前无官方补丁，建议停止使用该软件或通过防火墙限制访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0128"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Daniel Beckham Finger Server 0.82 Beta 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即更换为安全维护中的替代服务（如系统内置 in.fingerd），或直接禁用 finger 服务（79/tcp）。若必须继续使用，应在输入处理层严格过滤 `;&|$()` 等 shell 元字符，并在防火墙限制 finger 端口仅允许可信来源访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0128","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19745","http://www.glazed.org/finger/changelog.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7610"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0333.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0333.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0309","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0125","title":"Wired Community Software WWWThreads 5.0 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Wired Community Software 开发的 WWWThreads 5.0 论坛软件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对传递给 SQL 查询的数字类型参数及表名未进行充分过滤和净化处理，导致远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，向查询参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而非法获取论坛管理权限，进而实现数据窃取、篡改或完全控制论坛系统。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0125"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03Z","remediation":"建议升级至 WWWThreads 5.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 SQL 查询中数值参数和表名参数未过滤的问题。如无法升级，应手动对所有传入 SQL 查询的用户输入进行严格过滤：数值参数使用 int() 强制类型转换，表名参数采用白名单校验，禁止直接拼接用户输入到 SQL 语句中，同时使用参数化查询替代字符串拼接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/967","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10002031027120.15921-100000%40eight.wiretrip.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19741","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0125","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0125.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vmr6-rxwm-662f/GHSA-vmr6-rxwm-662f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001150.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0193","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0193.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0218","title":"Linux mount/umount 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 和 BSD 系统的 mount/umount 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 umount 命令传递超长相对路径名参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 发行版及 BSD 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地账号才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0218"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.15 及以上版本，或安装对应发行版的安全补丁（如 Red Hat 的 RHSA-2000:004）。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 mount/umount 二进制文件的 setuid 位：chmod u-s /bin/umount /bin/mount，但会影响普通用户正常卸载文件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6980","http://www.osvdb.org/7004","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/321","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0218","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0218.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2qhm-m4wg-jvfv/GHSA-2qhm-m4wg-jvfv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83001/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b3dff3bb-99fd-45fe-9b49-3b94145dd1c0.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0193.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0193.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0115","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0127","title":"Progress WebSpeed WSMadmin 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"Progress Webspeed 配置程序未正确禁用对 WSMadmin 管理工具的访问权限，远程攻击者可通过 wsisa.dll 利用该配置缺陷，无需身份认证即可获取系统管理权限。该漏洞影响 Progress Webspeed 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者可借此完全控制目标 Web 服务及应用系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0127"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Progress Webspeed 至 KB 19412 补丁对应版本，或限制通过 Web 服务器配置禁止对 wsisa.dll 及 WSMadmin 管理接口的远程访问，仅允许受信任 IP 段访问该管理路径，并确保 Webspeed 配置程序正确禁用 WSMadmin 实用工具的未授权访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.progress.com/services/support/cgi-bin/techweb-kbase.cgi/webkb.html?kbid=19412&keywords=security%20Webspeed","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0127","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0127.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/805.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8071b769fede4de3c82d6e52f9a03fe18758c5f0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9qx-grqj-38gf/GHSA-g9qx-grqj-38gf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/webspeed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0115.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0115.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0113","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0124","title":"surfCONTROL SuperScout 安全绕过漏洞","description":"surfCONTROL SuperScout 网页内容过滤软件在处理以点号（.）结尾的网站 URL 时存在分类失效漏洞。当用户访问带有尾部点号的域名时，该软件无法正确识别和匹配预设的访问控制策略，导致被限制访问的网站被错误地归类为允许访问，从而使内部用户能够绕过 Web 访问限制规则。攻击者只需在受限制网站的域名末尾添加一个点号即可触发该漏洞，利用难度极低，影响企业内容过滤策略的有效性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0124"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03Z","remediation":"升级到 surfCONTROL SuperScout 最新可用版本，或迁移至受支持的 Web 过滤解决方案（如 Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps 或 Forcepoint Web Security）。在 URL 过滤规则中增加对尾随点号（.）的规范化处理，确保所有 URL 在分类前去除末尾点号。如无法升级，在代理服务器或网关层面添加自定义规则，将含末尾点号的 URL 重写为标准格式后再进行过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0124","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0124.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gh2j-73gh-h7q7/GHSA-gh2j-73gh-h7q7.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8892aa1b-c8ff-4996-bb27-2cb657cfab4f.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0113.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0110","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0122","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions htimage.exe 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中的 htimage.exe CGI 程序存在物理路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 GET 请求即可触发该程序返回详细的错误信息，从而获取虚拟目录对应的真实物理路径。该漏洞导致服务器敏感信息暴露，可能辅助攻击者实施进一步渗透攻击。受影响版本包括 Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 的多个版本，建议禁用 htimage.exe 或安装厂商补丁进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0122"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02Z","remediation":"升级 Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 至 2000 年 3 月之后的安全更新版本，或禁用 htimage.exe CGI 程序的匿名访问。在 IIS 中设置 htimage.exe 仅允许经过身份验证的用户访问，或在 Web 服务器上删除或重命名该 CGI 文件以彻底消除路径泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/470458/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/964","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/34719","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0122","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0122.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-353v-v7pq-8gpc/GHSA-353v-v7pq-8gpc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/964/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001148.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0522","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0469","title":"Selena Sol WebBanner 4.0 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Selena Sol WebBanner 4.0 产品中存在严重的路径遍历漏洞，该软件在处理用户请求时未能有效验证路径输入，导致攻击者可通过发送包含 \"../\" 目录遍历序列的恶意请求绕过访问控制。攻击者可利用这一漏洞读取目标服务器上的任意文件，包括敏感系统配置文件、用户凭证、数据库连接信息等安全数据。漏洞影响 WebBanner 4.0 所有版本，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程实施攻击，但需精确知道目标文件路径，攻击复杂度较高。该漏洞同时影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性，潜在损失可能导致企业数据泄露、系统被攻破等严重后果。微软及相关安全厂商已确认此漏洞并发布相关安全补丁，建议用户及时升级到最新版本以获取防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0469"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48Z","remediation":"升级 Selena Sol WebBanner 至 4.0 以上修复版本，或在 Web 服务器配置中启用路径规范化检查、禁用目录遍历（如 Apache 配置 AllowOverride None 并限制 FollowSymLinks）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\\\ 的请求路径，并限制 Web 服务进程对敏感目录的读取权限。建议升级至 WebBanner 4.1 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1347","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-22&msg=ILENKALMCAFBLHBGEOFKGEJCCAAA.jwesterink%40jwesterink.daxis.nl","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=4.2.0.58.20000620193604.00979950%40mail.clark.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0469","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0469.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvxh-v3hv-2g35/GHSA-gvxh-v3hv-2g35.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3266a44e-62ce-4c10-96b9-186c4c33489b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0096","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0112","title":"Debian GNU/Linux MBR 默认配置安全漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 默认安装过程中使用了不安全的 MBR（主引导记录），本地攻击者可在系统安装阶段通过软盘启动系统，绕过已有安全限制。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 默认安装配置，属于本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者需要物理接触目标系统并具有软盘引导权限，利用方式为通过软盘引导进入系统后获取未授权访问。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0112"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01Z","remediation":"安装 Debian GNU/Linux 时在 BIOS 中设置启动密码并将首选启动设备设为硬盘，禁止从软盘/CD-ROM 引导。完成安装后立即移除可移动介质并在 BIOS 中禁用软盘启动，同时设置物理安全策略限制本地控制台访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94973075614088&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/960","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0112","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0112.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/35654e096c2a49809e9bb5907f49e27c931fdaa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-992g-c72f-vm8c/GHSA-992g-c72f-vm8c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001146.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ca03f6ab-f187-46e1-8849-8042206df44e.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0001","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0114","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 匿名账户名称信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `/_vti_bin/` 虚拟目录下的 `shtml.dll` 发送特制的 RPC POST 请求，获取服务器上匿名账户的名称。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，获取的信息可用于进一步的社会工程学攻击或系统渗透。该漏洞影响运行 FrontPage Server Extensions 的多种 Windows 平台，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0114"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01Z","remediation":"立即卸载 FrontPage Server Extensions（FPSE）组件，该产品已停止维护，继续使用存在信息泄露风险。如业务必须保留，在 IIS 管理器中删除 /_vti_bin/ 虚拟目录的匿名访问权限，仅允许经过身份验证的用户访问，并使用 URLScan 工具过滤对 shtml.dll 的 RPC POST 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0114.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0114.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1c48d2f992abe8752e6b0132b36baf70af48d1d3/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2000-0114-1296.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2000-0114-1297.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Internet%20Information%20Services%EF%BC%88IIS%EF%BC%89/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2000-0114-1297.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2000-0114_8.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/README.md","https://github.com/Cappricio-Securities/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/adhamelhansye/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/Josekutty-K/frontpage-server-extensions-vulnerability-scanner"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1147","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1205","title":"Apache HTTP Server 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.0 至 1.3.11 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过以下途径实施攻击：(1) printenv CGI 脚本（printenv.pl）未对输出进行编码，导致反射型 XSS；(2) ap_send_error_response 函数生成的错误页面（如 404 页面）未指定明确字符集，可被利用执行恶意脚本；(3) 部分 Apache 模块及核心代码生成的消息未正确过滤用户输入。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用这些漏洞，诱使其他用户访问特制链接，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证或实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1205"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.12 或更高版本，该版本已修复 printenv.pl 输出编码问题和错误响应页面字符集设置缺陷。如无法升级，删除或禁用 printenv.pl CGI 脚本（位于 cgi-bin/ 目录），并在 httpd.conf 中设置 AddDefaultCharset UTF-8 以防止浏览器自动检测编码执行脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archive.cert.uni-stuttgart.de/bugtraq/2002/12/msg00243.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-12/0233.html","http://httpd.apache.org/info/css-security/apache_specific.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=118529436424127&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10938","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/35597","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3