S 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0136"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"升级到已修复隐藏表单字段信任问题的软件版本；若厂商已停止支持，应迁移至仍受支持的购物车系统。核心修复措施为服务端对所有表单提交参数（包括隐藏字段）进行完整性校验，将价格/数量等敏感数据存储于服务端 Session 而非 HTML 隐藏字段，防止客户端篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0136","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19951","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0136","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0136.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/986f88b713cae42a05d283e54e6fe229a76d2603/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h9x3-27xw-3788/GHSA-h9x3-27xw-3788.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88307/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0520970a-aa78-4989-ab6b-04a33f5e042e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0406.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0400","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0133","title":"H. Nomura Tiny FTPd 多个缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"H. Nomura Tiny FTP Daemon 0.52 beta3 的多个命令处理函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送特制的 STOR、RNTO、MKD、XMKD、RMD、XRMD、APPE、SIZE 及 RNFR 等命令参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标系统以服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，影响 Tiny FTPd 0.52 beta3 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0133"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Tiny FTPd 0.52 beta3，该软件已停止维护多年且无安全补丁可用。迁移至 vsftpd（Linux）或 FileZilla Server（Windows）等持续维护的 FTP 服务器软件，并确保仅对可信网络开放 FTP 服务。如在边界防火墙上阻止外部对 TCP 端口 21 的访问，可将攻击面降至最低。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/961","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19737","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0133.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2006/CVE-2006-7007.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0133","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0133/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0133.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0133.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/adcfef9b65b946e8e253b7ae8cc7b9873faa0681/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fhqg-mpm6-q7p8/GHSA-fhqg-mpm6-q7p8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nes